.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-upsells - Manage upsells and cross-sells


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad upsells [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage upsells and cross-sells.

.PP
An upsell offers a buyer a different version of the product they are buying.
A cross-sell offers a different product (optionally discounted) to buyers of
selected products, or to buyers of every product when it is universal.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for upsells


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad upsells list
  gumroad upsells create --name "Upgrade" --product <id> --offer-variant <selected_id>:<offered_id>
  gumroad upsells create --name "Audiobook" --product <id> --cross-sell --selected-product <id> --percent-off 50
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-upsells-create(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-upsells-delete(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-upsells-list(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-upsells-update(1)\fP, \fBgumroad-upsells-view(1)\fP
